Upgrade note
------------

When bullmq is upgraded, re-extract these six files from the new
`dist/cjs/scripts/*.js` and update the version references above. The Go call
sites in producer.go / worker.go pass the same keys and argument tuples the
matching JavaScript methods build; a script version bump therefore has to be
checked against `classes/scripts.js` as well.
